# Card art

Card images live here as **PNG**, named to match the `image` field of each
entry in `config.lua`. The UI crops them to 170x140 cards with
`object-fit: cover`, so square or landscape art at 300x200 or larger works best.

**36 of the 78 referenced filenames ship with the resource.**
The rest fall back to a category icon (🐾 for animals, 🤠 for people), so a
missing file is never a broken image — you can add art gradually.

Some entries deliberately share art: the legendary variants reuse their base
animal's card, for instance.

This folder and `config.lua` are both left outside escrow, so you can
add your own transformables and their art freely.

